OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe video of officer
OL,4,Ahitting youth with handcuffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has said it is reviewing
OL,7,Fa video which shows one of its officers
OL,8,Fpunching a boy.
OL,10,FThe footage circulated on social media
OL,11,Fshows a Merseyside Police officer
OL,12,Fpunching what appears to be teenage boy
OL,13,Fthree times while holding a pair of
OL,14,Fmetal handcuffs in the hand he is
OL,15,Fstriking him with.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
