OL,3,GNEWSAPolice probe video of officer
OL,4,Ahitting youth with handcuffs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said officers had been
OL,7,Fresponding on Friday to reports of
OL,8,Fabout 20 youths in the Alder Wood
OL,9,FAvenue area of Speke, Liverpool,
OL,10,Fblocking roads with wheelie bins and
OL,11,F"aiming fireworks at anyone who tried
OL,12,Fto remove them".
OL,14,F"We would like to stress that a short
OL,15,Fclip doesn't always show the full
OL,16,Fcontext," a Merseyside Police spokesman
OL,17,Fsaid.
